WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.633 --> 00:00:07.553
where health officials say two people, both unvaccinated, have died

00:00:07.553 --> 00:00:11.273
from measles. No further details about the individuals were provided.

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:15.353
They are the first measles-related deaths in the US this year, which

00:00:15.353 --> 00:00:20.833
is on track to be the worst year for measles cases since 1991. Pennsylvania

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:24.573
Governor Josh Shapiro today warned about the severity of the outbreak

00:00:24.573 --> 00:00:27.903
and the rise of misinformation regarding vaccines.

00:00:28.343 --> 00:00:30.733
There's real life consequences to scaring people

00:00:31.663 --> 00:00:36.513
and not relying on actual doctors and actual medical professionals

00:00:36.513 --> 00:00:42.903
to provide unbiased information to parents so that we can make reasonable

00:00:42.903 --> 00:00:46.903
decisions for our kids, the governor added that he spoke with US

00:00:46.903 --> 00:00:50.863
Health Secretary Robert F. Kennedy Jr. who has pushed to revise the

00:00:50.863 --> 00:00:55.463
nation's approach to vaccines. Shapiro says he was blunt with him

00:00:55.463 --> 00:00:58.083
about the rhetoric coming from government officials.

00:00:58.653 --> 00:01:00.027
The Trump administration is threatening to demolish the Kennedy Center
